ribodecode.readme:
This fold contains datasets for tranlation model of RiboDecode.

genes.csv: training and test genes;
human_coding_transcript_sequences.csv: transcript sequences of human coding genes (gencode.v28);
mjIsoform_320.csv: major isoforms of the 320 samples determined by RSEM;
RNA_RPKM_320.csv: RNA-seq counts (in RPKM) of the 320 samples;
RPF_RPKM_320.csv: Ribo-seq counts (in RPKM) of the 320 samples;
sample_information.csv: sample meta and group of the 320 samples
